<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Children are the Lord’s heritage, so dear in God’s eyes!</l><l>Just like arrows in quiver aimed for Satan’s demise!</l><l>Even though they might trouble us and vex our soul,</l><l>We must learn to recover them and not let them go!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, we thank You for all the ones You’ve placed here with us</l><l>To express You and represent You—how glorious!</l><l>Chosen vessels, containers to be filled with You;</l><l>Let’s keep fighting, dispensing with God’s purpose in view!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
